{"title":"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/4/8e44ca2cae6be42148fe1b1fd8b5d55bd6b599bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/2/ae2b1e8043492b1ef1c38d831e077be08c860f30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(k^3 - 8)(k + 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"21\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/b/2dba911126f5048a2c5ba8e07e03d753f9a2f103.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 0 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 3 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 6 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 8 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ -6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"410\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/4/8e44ca2cae6be42148fe1b1fd8b5d55bd6b599bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/c/36c2cd94fb3e96d015a1e99573d681edafbf325c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(k^3 - 8)(k + 1) = (2^3 - 8)(2 + 1) = (8 - 8)(3) = 0 \\times 3 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"508\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Distributing the initial expression and then plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/4/8e44ca2cae6be42148fe1b1fd8b5d55bd6b599bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/b/c1b64e3f85ebf0b9b318eb70b0642708eb61a333.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(k^3 - 8)(k + 1) = k^4 - 8k + k^3 - 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"274\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/8/c885c58854bac62a2b9ec29667a6f7af9484073e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2^4 - 8 \\times 2 + 2^3 - 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"170\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/6/23654f61047a9cca93442cc8a67f2db3e8a0b740.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=16 - 8 \\times 2 + 8 - 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"164\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/c/adcb956eca019277e2da81df37792a9478726341.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=16 - 16 + 8 - 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"142\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>We can see that everything cancels out, giving that the expression is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/3/b5356a7353854e19b133c5ace4ee18c5d3fc82da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"58\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal\">1999 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 22 (page does not exist)\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_23&amp;ac